<!--Post: 5457--><!--Time: 1107136034-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5457"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Tippy<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Tippy<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, January 30, 2005 - 5:47 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Or maybe not...I believe there was a movie called &#34;Sacrifice&#34; that featured some sort of killer that picked his victims because they had abortions.  I heard that - didn&#39;t see the movie. <BR> <BR>BTK in one letter said, &#34;you figure out the motive&#34;.  That&#39;s tough to do when the victims seem to have nothing in common - at least not much. <BR> <BR>Yet - BTK does mention that &#39;most&#39; of the victims are women.   <BR> <BR>The vast majority of prolife people are super citizens, but the ones who go wacky - go WAY wacky.  For them - killing others who have had - or perform abortions is doing sacred work. <BR> <BR>BTK did not sexually abuse the women - but he DID bind their legs together - at the knees.  Were all found that way?  Maybe someone can fill in my lack of knowledge.   <BR> <BR>But consider this - Roe V Wade was passed not long before BTK began killing.  Just the year previous.   <BR> <BR>Abortion bombers don&#39;t care who gets killed in the blast - as long as their intended victim is among the casualities. <BR> <BR>Enter the Otero family.  BTK waited until Joe left.  Did he know he would return?  What if his intended was the mother?  The rest were the collateral damage. <BR> <BR>A poster here mentioned something about biblical factors of &#34;spilling seed&#34;.  I figure BTK for a fanatical religious sort, as I mentioned before, but suppose he actually felt he had the &#39;right&#39; to implement a death penalty - quite the same as some of the early Church Fathers would have done? <BR> <BR>After some research - it becomes clear that in some societies - the penalty for early termination of a pregnancy - was death.  Sometimes it was disfigurement. <BR> <BR>One interesting thing was that in many cases - the woman was branded or some sort of symbol was carved into her skin. <BR> <BR>Do we know for sure that BTK&#39;s victims never bore any such symbol?  What are the secret symbols on the boxes?  The letters? <BR> <BR>Binding the women&#39;s legs shut - indicates something - I&#39;d bet on it.  What kind of symbolic implications does that carry?  Why shut their legs?  Forever?  And then - masturbating on them - as if it was an appropriate response to something...  Could that something have been an abortion? <BR> <BR>Biblically, the children are often held responsible for the parent&#39;s sins.  Did BTK operate on that kind of warped justification? <BR> <BR>I wonder if there is any way to track down records for the women - to see if any of them had aborted.  And perhaps mentioned it...at work?  <BR> <BR>If that was his motivation - he should be fairly easy to find.   <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5457-->
<!--Post: 5460--><!--Time: 1107137747-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5460"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Tippy<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Tippy<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, January 30, 2005 - 6:15 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->One more thing.  I read the Otero letter again.  Both female&#39;s bondage method was described - both had their legs bound shut.  And he noted that specifically.   <BR> <BR>Both males were bound - period.  He did not elaborate as to how.  <BR> <BR>Who knows how the other women were bound? <BR> <BR>If you have to subdue someone - their legs - it makes sense to bind their ankles - but their knees?   <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5460-->
<!--Post: 5470--><!--Time: 1107141066-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5470"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Dee<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Dee<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, January 30, 2005 - 7:11 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Great post Tippy.  One other thing to know...  Were the bindings done PRE mortum or POST mortum?  An autopsy should have been able to tell that based on the ligature &#40;sp&#41; marks.  <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5470-->
<!--Post: 5472--><!--Time: 1107142311-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5472"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Dee<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Dee<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, January 30, 2005 - 7:31 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Also, after doing some research, I have found out that Wichita, KS is &#34;America&#39;s Abortion Capital&#34;. <BR> <BR><a href="http://www.operationrescue.org/archives/000148.shtml" target=_top>http://www.operationrescue.org/archives/000148.sht ml</a> <BR>  <!--/Text--></td></tr>
