<!--Post: 5481--><!--Time: 1107144668-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5481"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Dee<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Dee<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, January 30, 2005 - 8:11 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Lily...  I hope you aren&#39;t talking about me.  I am liking your theory.  I was just giving some more background; furthering the possiblity that you may be on to something.  I&#39;m not debating.  I&#39;m trying to bainstorm with you.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5481-->
<!--Post: 5482--><!--Time: 1107144804-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5482"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Jim44095<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Jim44095<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, January 30, 2005 - 8:13 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I don&#39;t see where it has turned into a right to life debate,a genuine question was raised,don&#39;t post on this thread if you don&#39;t have anything to contribute to the  theory.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5482-->
<!--Post: 5487--><!--Time: 1107146558-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5487"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Lilymarie<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lilymarie<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, January 30, 2005 - 8:42 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Dee - I just don&#39;t think that bringing in the emotional abortion issue is relevant here. All of the victims were not &#34;pre-life&#34;. No mention of zygote or fetus issues. I&#39;m sorry but I don&#39;t see the &#34;tie&#34; here...The victims were all born, fully recognized human beings. If I&#39;ve misinterprepted your original thought then I&#39;m sorry. <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5487-->
<!--Post: 5488--><!--Time: 1107146852-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5488"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Lilymarie<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lilymarie<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, January 30, 2005 - 8:47 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Dee - to answer your question.....I&#39;m not talking about you at all. I get concerned when this board goes off topic... &#34;right to life&#34; issues between us will NOT catch BTK. Please accept my apology.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5488-->
<!--Post: 5495--><!--Time: 1107148419-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5495"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Bodycheck<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Bodycheck<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, January 30, 2005 - 9:13 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->How in the world is any of this &#34;off-topic&#34;? <BR>the entire post is about abortion as a motive... <BR> <BR>nobody said anything about personal preference... <BR> <BR>Tippy...very interesting theory...although probably pretty hard to find proof of all the victims having abortions... <BR> <BR>id bet my socks, whatever the motive or common connection between them &#40;excluding Wegerle&#41; has been in the hands of the WPD for 30 years. <BR> <BR>its probably something so obvsious everyone has overlooked it...time and again... <BR> <BR>B<!--/Text--></td></tr>
