<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5531"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Scbenson2001<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Scbenson2001<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->6-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, January 31, 2005 - 4:55 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->The diffrence between abortion clinic bombers and btk is that abortion bombers are trying to do two things 1. dissuade people from performing abortions. 2. Stop people from getting them. They do this by LETTING PEOPLE KNOW why they are doing it. This way people are scared. BTK just kills people. If he where killing because he didn&#39;t like people who had abortions wouldn&#39;t he tell somebody to dissuade further abortions. Like have an abortion and you may get a  visit from me. No, BTK is a sexual killer. He says it in the same letter you quote from Tippy. &#34;You probably call me psychotic with sexual perversion hangup&#34;. He says it himself. Read his poetry &#34;I&#39;ll bring sexual death unto you for me&#34;. Case Closed.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
