<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5537"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Dee<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Dee<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, January 31, 2005 - 6:48 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->&#34;Sexual death&#34;, in its true meaning, is a term that means a woman has reached a menopausal state; therefore not being able to have any more children.  Perhaps Mr. B was bringing &#34;sexual death&#34; to his victims so they could not get pregnant again and terminate another pregnancy.  Who knows what goes through a psycho&#39;s mind?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
