<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5544"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Scbenson2001<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Scbenson2001<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->6-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, January 31, 2005 - 7:34 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->He masterbated over their bodies. They where sexually motivated killings. Just because he did not have sex with them means nothing. His turn on sexually is the control and torture of his victims thats why he calls himself BIND TORTURE KILL. Its not ABORTION MEANS DEATH or something. I&#39;m sorry but your way off here. Also your &#34;ancient moral battle&#34; statement makes me tend to believe you have motives for bringing this into the conversation on this web site. <!--/Text--></td></tr>
