<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5547"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Tippy<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Tippy<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, January 31, 2005 - 7:59 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Scbenson2001 - My only motive for bringing this specific discussion is because I think it might have some merit.  So far - none of the other theories have netted BTK. <BR> <BR>I have provided information that serial killers often act out their justification of &#34;punishing sinners&#34;. <BR> <BR>I hope you will keep an open mind on this. <BR> <BR>I have been doing a lot of research and it seems to back up my theory, at least hypothetically.  I am not declaring that this is true - just that we need to think more along these kinds of lines, since other serial killers have operated on like motives - like prostitution, etc. <BR> <BR>I want to post something very interesting here. <BR> <BR>If BTK was subjected to this kind of philosophy when growing up - it would not be a wonder that he would later act out.  This first link is to a message board,  if you scroll down - you will find a poster calling himself a &#34;reverend&#34;.  Read the caption under his photo.   <BR> <BR><a href="http://www.shiachat.com/forum/index.php?showtopic=34570&amp;st=0" target=_top>http://www.shiachat.com/forum/index.php?showtopic= 34570&amp;st=0</a> <BR> <BR>Following up on this I traced him to a very fanatical site where they declare aborted babies are headed for Hell.  I will post a small blurb here from the site - notice the use of the doll.  What did the FAncy Nancy doll look like? <BR> <BR>&#60;quote&#62;&#34;To illustrate this finer point i produced an old baby doll, of which I have several saved from the early 80&#39;s when they were outlawed for being highly flammable. <BR> <BR>&#34;Look at the cute little baby! Isn&#39;t he just adorable???&#34; I yelled. &#34;But his mommy decided she didn&#39;t have to listen to God and allow the fine republicans in office tell her what to do so she decided to KILL her innocent child!&#34; <BR> <BR>Flicking open a zippo lighter confiscated last week from a father I caught smoking in front of his children, I lit that baby doll on fire &#40;which I had previously doused in gasoline&#41; as I exclaimed... &#34;THIS POOR BABY IS NOW BURNING IN HELL BECAUSE OF HIS EVIL, SICK, PERVERTED MOMMY!!!&#34; <BR>&#34;&#60;end&#62; <BR> <BR>Here is the rest of that church site:   <BR><a href="http://p203.ezboard.com/ftruechristiansunitefrm7.showMessage?topicID=85.topic" target=_top>http://p203.ezboard.com/ftruechristiansunitefrm7.s howMessage?topicID=85.topic</a> <BR> <BR> <BR> <BR>Okay - that scares me. <BR> <BR> <BR>Again - I&#39;m not saying BTK was operating on the same wave length, but can you see some similarities here? <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
