<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5550"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Topsailgrl<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Topsailgrl<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, January 31, 2005 - 8:21 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Tippy, I agree that binding the women&#39;s legs closed has merit. I don&#39;t know if it is abortion related though.  <BR> <BR>It could be a many number of things. I personally believe binding the women&#39;s legs closed is a sexual thing. He did not molest them in a way that is obvious to us but we do not know for sure if they were not molested in other less obvious ways. Molestation can take many forms. We know that he ejaculated at the scenes. Do we know if he did this while they were alive or dead? Do we know where he touched them while they were yet still alive? Do we know if he made them touch themselves as he &#34;watched?&#34;  <BR> <BR>The <i>typical</i> fanatic that goes after women who are either contemplating abortion/have had abortions or doctors that perform abortions usually have a clear message they want to send.  <BR> <BR>I have all kinds of little theories running through my head on this guy but it is really hard to get into the head of a monster like him. Especially since the police are reluctant to give good information.  <BR> <BR>I feel certain he has &#34;Mommy&#34; issues. He may have been molested in some way by his mother, or a boyfriend of some kind of his mother&#39;s and she didn&#39;t protect him. He could have seen his mother having sex, he could have been a little &#34;peeper&#34; back when he was a kid. Knowing full well it was wrong but unable to stop himself. It could be something as simple as him witnessing a kindness that these women either showed to their own children or to a child.  <BR> <BR>I could go on and on and on with theories that run through my head on this guy. But I really do not think abortion had anything to do with it. Agreed though, that there are some real fruit cakes out there when it comes to that subject. <!--/Text--></td></tr>
