<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5551"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Scbenson2001<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Scbenson2001<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->6-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, January 31, 2005 - 8:35 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->No I don&#39;t. God is brought into these discussions by serial killer usually only after they are caught. They use it as an excuse. Thats it. Gary Ridgeway killed prostitutes. He killed them for no relious reasons. He also stabbed a six-year old boy. He did this when he was a teenager. Jack the Ripper killed prostitutes. NONE of the RIPPER LETTERS as they are called, are not by all experts in the case actually from the killer they are fakes! If your only motive is too post your theory very well. I always keep my mind open, accept to things I find ridicules. I&#39;m sorry but I find this to be such an occurence<!--/Text--></td></tr>
