<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5563"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Lilymarie<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lilymarie<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, January 31, 2005 - 10:01 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->BTK&#39;s crimes were SEXUAL and SADISTIC. He masturbated and ejaculated several times on and near the victims. We don&#39;t know what else he did to them or made them do. I guess the only thing ruled out is violent physical penetration. He does have an agenda - but it only exists in his huge narcissistic head.  <BR> <BR>The only intention for starting this thread is to further a personal agenda regarding abortion. There are probably &#34;thousands&#34; of fanatical sites that would absolutely love to see the sick links posted above.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
