<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5566"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Tippy<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Tippy<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, January 31, 2005 - 10:30 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Lily - since I have no personal agenda regarding abortion - that would be pretty hard to do. <BR> <BR>For goodness sake - we&#39;ve even discussed demon possession on this forum.  My theory is just that - a theory. <BR> <BR>I think it has merit.  You don&#39;t.  That&#39;s okay.   <BR> <BR>Serial killers have motives - until we find out what BTK&#39;s is - let&#39;s not just rule things out because we feel uncomfortable discussing them. <BR> <BR>I, for one, would like to see BTK caught.  If we can share ideas without becoming defensive - it might be easier for all of us. <BR> <BR>I agree the links were sick - but serial killers are a sick lot.  We have to get into their mind.  Try to see like they do.  They don&#39;t think normally, lily.   <BR> <BR> <BR>And - I would be VERY interested in seeing what Fancy Nancy doll looked like. <BR> <BR>Can anyone link me to an existing pic?  I missed it before.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
