<!--Post: 5574--><!--Time: 1107200269-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5574"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Lilymarie<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lilymarie<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, January 31, 2005 - 11:37 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Tip - I don&#39;t think you&#39;re off-base with trying to find something that ties these crimes together. In fact, the thing that is most striking about them is the fact that the victims are all quite different. Grown women, female child, grown men &#40;1 survived&#41;, male child.  <BR> <BR>I just don&#39;t buy the theory that these crimes were directed only at women. If so, he would have just killed the others because they were witnesses. But he didn&#39;t JUST kill them. He tortured them too. Poor Julie....that crime was much against her as it was her mother. Little Joe, and Joseph were bound and strangled in a slow, horrible manner.  <BR> <BR>It would be fascinating if someone found something, anything that resembled a common thread between the victims. My guess &#40;my guess only&#41; is that the victims are just objects to BTK. They were chosen during BTK&#39;s everyday life &#40;job, shopping, hobby?&#41;, followed and watched, fantasy developed, preparations made, and we all know the rest. I just don&#39;t think there is a religious, political or social agenda. It&#39;s the work of a sexual sadist trying to satisfy fantasies &#40;the monster&#41;.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
