<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5745"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->George<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->George<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->7-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, February 01, 2005 - 8:28 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->&#42; I happen to believe ONS deceased, probably because of such fearless &#40;which can mean reckless&#41; <BR>behavior. Sorry for long post, hit &#34;post&#34; before editing accidentally.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
